  "description": "<p>When requesting a list of versions for a binary resource, for example <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/karaka3:1187/FILE0/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/karaka3:1187/FILE0/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/</a></p>\n\n<p>text/turtle returns the correct order of versions, in a descending order:</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n        ldp:contains           &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/karaka3:1187/FILE0/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/20211018121711&gt; ;\r\n</span>        ldp:contains           &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/karaka3:1187/FILE0/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/20210927124149&gt; ;\r\n</span>        ldp:contains           &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/karaka3:1187/FILE0/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/20210429102326&gt; ;\r\n</span>        ldp:contains           &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/karaka3:1187/FILE0/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/20210416115949&gt; ;</span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>but application/ld+json returns a random order:</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n\t\t        <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains\"</span>: [\r\n</span>            {\r\n                <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/karaka3:1187/FILE0/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/20210429102326\"</span>\r\n</span>            },\r\n            {\r\n                <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/karaka3:1187/FILE0/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/20211018121711\"</span>\r\n</span>            },\r\n            {\r\n                <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/karaka3:1187/FILE0/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/20210927124149\"</span>\r\n</span>            },\r\n            {\r\n                <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/karaka3:1187/FILE0/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/20210416115949\"</span>\r\n</span>            }\r\n        ],\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
